  "title": "Better tests, faster. GitHub Copilot does the heavy lifting (Repeat)",
  "description": "AI agents write code faster than ever — but quality still matters. In this demo, see how GitHub Copilot transforms your testing workflow — from generating test suites to TDD-style agent development, catching edge cases, and validating agent-generated code before it merges. From unit tests to load testing, whether retrofitting a legacy codebase or building greenfield, see the patterns that keep AI-assisted development reliable and production-ready.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
